WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.240
Have you ever wondered about the deepest&nbsp;
desire of SCP-055, the self-keeping secret?&nbsp;

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.380
Foundation researchers used&nbsp;
SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:15.620
to snap a picture of SCP-055 while it was inside&nbsp;
of its containment cell. This was the result:

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.640
"Unknown."

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:22.220
A researcher misplaced the photograph, and it was&nbsp;
never found. The secret continues to keep itself.

